      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblin-proof\" or a \"goblin raid\"? I'm just looking for standard supply chain formulas for inventory buffer. Can you just stick to the mathematical side of the safety stock calculation? I need to show this to my manager and it needs to be professional.",
